{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 16\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff0821\u500b\uff09<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:73.98%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:7.35%;\"><col style=\"width:27%;\"><col style=\"width:30.73%;\"><col style=\"width:34.92%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>#<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u3053\u3068\u3070<\/strong><\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u6f22\u5b57<\/strong><\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u30d9\u30c8\u30ca\u30e0\u8a9e<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>1<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\uff5e\u3051\u3044<\/td><td>\uff5e\u7cfb<\/td><td>g\u1ed1c ~<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>2<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u304b\u3093\u3058<\/td><td>\u6f22\u5b57<\/td><td>H\u00e1n t\u1ef1<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>3<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3044\u307f<\/td><td>\u610f\u5473<\/td><td>\u00fd ngh\u0129a<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>4<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3060\u3044\u305f\u3044<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>5<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3046\u307e\u3044<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>ngon (\u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n), gi\u1ecfi (l\u00e0m g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>6<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30d8\u30eb\u30b7\u30fc\u306a<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>t\u1ed1t cho s\u1ee9c kho\u1ebb<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>7<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3066\u3093\u3077\u3089<\/td><td>\u5929\u3077\u3089<\/td><td>Tempura<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>8<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u304a\u3053\u306e\u307f\u3084\u304d<\/td><td>\u304a\u597d\u307f\u713c\u304d<\/td><td>Okonomiyaki<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>9<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u305f\u3053\u3084\u304d<\/td><td>\u305f\u3053\u713c\u304d<\/td><td>Takoyaki<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>10<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082<\/td><td>\u4f55\u3067\u3082<\/td><td>c\u00e1i g\u00ec c\u0169ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>11<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u306a\u3063\u3068\u3046<\/td><td>\u7d0d\u8c46<\/td><td>\u0111\u1eadu len men, natto<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>12<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u306b\u304a\u3044<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>m\u00f9i<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>13<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3072\u3069\u3044\uff08\u306b\u304a\u3044\uff09<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>gh\u00ea, kinh kh\u1ee7ng<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>14<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u308a\u3087\u3046\u308a\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>\u6599\u7406\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059<\/td><td>n\u1ea5u \u0103n<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>15<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u3068\u304f\u3044\u306a<\/td><td>\u5f97\u610f\u306a<\/td><td>t\u00e2m \u0111\u1eafc<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>16<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30ab\u30ec\u30fc<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>c\u00e0 ri<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>17<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u1ea4n \u0110\u1ed9<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>18<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30bf\u30a4<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>Th\u00e1i Lan<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>19<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30b7\u30f3\u30d7\u30eb\u306a<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>20<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30b7\u30fc\u30d5\u30fc\u30c9<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>h\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>21<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td>\u30c8\u30de\u30c8\u30bd\u30fc\u30b9<\/td><td>&nbsp;<\/td><td>s\u1ed1t c\u00e0 chua<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Unit 16\u30fb\u6587\u578b\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8<\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>A. <u>M\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>1. \u53ef\u80fd\u5f62\uff08\u304b\u306e\u3046\u3051\u3044\uff09<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Th\u1ec3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng<\/strong><\/p><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/p><p>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p bi\u1ec3u hi\u1ec7n t\u00ednh kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng. Ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3, vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u1ea3y ra.<\/p><p>b. C\u00e1ch chia:<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:64.69%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:44.06%;\"><col style=\"width:55.94%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\uff11\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\uff12\u3050\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u3042\u3044\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3042\u3048\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u306d\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u306d\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u3044\u304d\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3044\u3051\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u305f\u3079\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u305f\u3079\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u304d\u304d\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u304d\u3051\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u307f\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u307f\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u3068\u308a\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3068\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u304b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u304b\u305b\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\uff13\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u3088\u3073\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3088\u3079\u307e\u3059<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u304d\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3053\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">&nbsp;<\/td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\">\u3057\u307e\u3059\u21d2\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p>\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb <strong>\u3092<\/strong> \u0111\u1ee9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb s\u1ebd chuy\u1ec3n th\u00e0nh <strong>\u304c<\/strong>, c\u00f2n c\u00e1c tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0<strong>\u3000\u306b\u3001\u3067<\/strong>...v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean.&nbsp;<\/p><p>\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac c\u1ee7a th\u1ec3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng :<\/p><p>Danh t\u1eeb +<strong>\u304c <\/strong>(thay cho<strong>\u3092<\/strong> )+ \u0110\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb th\u1ec3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng: c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3.<\/p><p><i><u>V\u00ed d\u1ee5<\/u><\/i>: &nbsp; \u3055\u3057\u307f\u304c\u305f\u3079\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\uff08T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0103n sashimi\uff09<\/p><p>\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u304c\u8a71\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002\uff08T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 n\u00f3i ti\u1ebfng nh\u1eadt\uff09<br><br>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>2. \u301c\u307e\u3048\u306b\u3001\uff5e\u3002<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:49.94%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u5bdd\u308b<strong>\u307e\u3048\u306b<\/strong>\u3001\u306f\u3092\u307f\u304c\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111i ng\u1ee7 th\u00ec t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e1nh r\u0103ng.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3057\u3087\u304f\u3058\u306e<strong>\u307e\u3048\u306b<\/strong>\u3001\u624b\u3092\u3042\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi d\u00f9ng b\u1eefa th\u00ec t\u00f4i r\u1eeda tay.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>\u201cTr\u01b0\u1edbc khi l\u00e0m\u2026th\u00ec l\u00e0m \u2026\u201d,&nbsp; M\u1eabu c\u00e2u n\u00e0y bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb r\u1eb1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00e1c \u1edf \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 2 x\u1ea3y ra tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 1. \u0110\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 1 lu\u00f4n \u1edf th\u1ec3 nguy\u00ean d\u1ea1ng cho d\u00f9 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 2 c\u00f3 \u1edf th\u1eddi qu\u00e1 kh\u1ee9 hay t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;V1\u308b \u307e\u3048\u306b , V2.<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>N\u306e\u307e\u3048\u306b , V2.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p><i><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \uff08\uff0aN\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ee9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong><\/i><strong>\u307e\u3048\u306b<\/strong> <strong>l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb th\u00ec chia l\u00e0 <\/strong><i><strong>\uff36\u308b\u3001c\u00f2n n\u1ebfu l\u00e0 danh t\u1eeb th\u00ec l\u00e0<\/strong> <strong>\uff2e\u306e\uff09<\/strong><\/i><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>3. \u301c\u306e\u3067\u3001\u301c<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:56.77%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u3088\u3046\u3058\u304c\u3042\u308b<strong>\u306e\u3067<\/strong>\u3001\u306f\u3084\u304f\u5e30\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(V\u00ec c\u00f3 vi\u1ec7c b\u1eadn n\u00ean t\u00f4i v\u1ec1 s\u1edbm.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u5206\u304b\u3089\u306a\u3044<strong>\u306e\u3067<\/strong>\u3001\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(V\u00ec t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3u n\u00ean h\u00e3y ch\u1ec9 cho t\u00f4i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ec3u hi\u1ec7n bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1ch quan quan h\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n qu\u1ea3 nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t di\u1ec5n bi\u1ebfn t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean. V\u00ec\uff3b\u306e\u3067\uff3dc\u00f3 ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u1ee7 quan trong \u00fd ki\u1ebfn c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u00f3i, t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1eb9 \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nghe, n\u00ean n\u00f3 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00eau ra l\u00fd do khi xin ph\u00e9p, ho\u1eb7c khi l\u1eadp lu\u1eadn. .&nbsp;<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;\u3075\u3064\u3046\u5f62\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u306e\u3067\u3001\u301c\u3002<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>adj\u306a\uff0b\u3000\u306e\u3067\u3001\u301c\u3002<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>N\u306a\uff0b\u3000\u306e\u3067\u3001\u301c\u3002<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>4. \uff5e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:48.76%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u6f22\u5b57\u304c\u8aad\u3081\u308b<strong>\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f<\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>(Gi\u1edd t\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1eef h\u00e1n r\u1ed3i.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3058\u3066\u3093\u3057\u3083\u306b\u306e\u308c\u308b<strong>\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f<\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(Gi\u1edd t\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xe \u0111\u1ea1p r\u1ed3i.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>Bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb s\u1ef1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1eeb tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ed9t vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;V<strong>\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002<\/strong><\/p><p>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<\/p><p><strong>B. <u>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e1ch di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t hay d\u00f9ng:<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>5. \u3060\u304b\u3089\uff0f\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3089<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:58.9%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u306e\u305f\u3093\u3058\u3087\u3046\u3073\u3002<strong>\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3089<\/strong>\u3001\u306f\u3084\u304f\u5e30\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3002<\/p><p>( H\u00f4m nay l\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt con t\u00f4i. v\u00ec v\u1eady, t\u00f4i v\u1ec1 s\u1edbm.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u6642\u9593\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002<strong>\u3060\u304b\u3089<\/strong>\u3001\u3044\u305d\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(Ch\u00fang ta kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1eddi gian n\u1eefa. V\u00ec v\u1eady, h\u00e3y nhanh l\u00ean.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00eau k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3, h\u1ec7 qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a c\u00e2u tr\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u00e2u \u0111i li\u1ec1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 l\u00fd do, ph\u00e1n \u0111o\u00e1n, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng nhi\u00ean..&nbsp;<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>A\u3000\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3089\uff0f\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3000B<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>6. \uff5e\u65b9<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:59.37%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u6f22\u5b57\u306e\u8aad\u307f<strong>\u65b9(\u304b\u305f\uff09<\/strong>\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u3002<\/p><p>( H\u00e3y ch\u1ec9 cho t\u00f4i c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc ch\u1eef h\u00e1n.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u3053\u306e\u304d\u304b\u3044\u306e\u3064\u304b\u3044<strong>\u65b9\uff08\u304b\u305f\uff09<\/strong>\u306f\u3080\u305a\u304b\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1i m\u00e1y n\u00e0y r\u1ea5t kh\u00f3 .)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p, bi\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p, c\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u00e0nh vi n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3. c\u00f3 ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 : C\u00e1ch\u2026<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;V\uff0b\u65b9\uff08\u304b\u305f\uff09<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>7.&nbsp; \u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:59.27%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p><strong>\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082<\/strong>\u98f2\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(t\u00f4i c\u00f3 u\u1ed1ng t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9.)<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082<\/strong>\u98df\u3079\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0103n t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p><p>Di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a \u201cb\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec\u201d, \u201cb\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 v\u1eadt g\u00ec\u201d, \u201ct\u1ea5t c\u1ea3\u201d..&nbsp;<\/p><p>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<strong>\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082\uff0bV\u307e\u3059<\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n"}